{"results":[{"url":"https://komonews.com/news/local/man-arrested-in-connection-with-arson-inside-bothell-fred-meyer-store-thrashers-corner-fire-inside-crime-police-fire-departments","final_url":"https://komonews.com/news/local/man-arrested-in-connection-with-arson-inside-bothell-fred-meyer-store-thrashers-corner-fire-inside-crime-police-fire-departments","title":"Man arrested in arson inside Bothell Fred Meyer store","description":"Bothell police on Thursday arrested a suspect on suspicion of first-degree arson at a Fred Meyer store last week.","language":"en","text":"# Man arrested in arson inside Bothell Fred Meyer store\n\n---\n\nThu, August 13, 2026 at 9:28 AM\n\nCrews at the scene of the fire inside the Bothell Fred Meyer on Aug. 4, 2026. (Bothell Fire Department)\n\nBothell police on Thursday arrested a suspect on suspicion of first-degree arson at a Fred Meyer store last week.\n\nOn the afternoon of Aug. 4, Bothell Fire Department crews responded to reports of smoke and flames inside the store near Thrasher's Corner.\n\nThe fire alarm and sprinkler systems came on, and everyone in the store safely evacuated.\n\nCrews had to ventilate the building.\n\nThrough the investigation, Bothell police identified a suspect.\n\nK-9 and drone teams assisted the Bothell Police Department's Investigations Unit and Community Crime Reduction Team with taking the suspect into custody.","author":"Unknown Author","published_date":"2026-08-13T16:28:05.000Z","latency_ms":382.10293299999876,"format":"markdown"}],"errors":[]}